- Spec: stage-1 §4 gives cancellation_cutoff_minutes as "A booking cannot be cancelled or changed within this many minutes of its start" and states NO upper bound. A cutoff wider than any lead time is legitimate: everything is inside the cutoff, so every cancel or PATCH answers 409 cutoff_passed.
